><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2016</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">년 단기 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">WEST </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">참가 신청<font face=\"맑은 고딕\">학</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">생의 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">학년</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">학점</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">영어성적 등 자격 요건</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">을 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">자체 심사</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">하여 프로그램자격 요건을 충족하는 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">우수 학생</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">을 추천하오니 관심있는 학생들의 많은 지원 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-